  Q("Is 'each angel is its own species' a dogma?",[["Yes","No."],["No, it is a Thomist thesis","Correct."],["It was defined at Lateran IV","No."],["It is heresy","No."]],1,"q.50 a.4",{bloom:"Evaluate",terms:["angel-species"],diff:2})
